sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor A as Analyst
  participant P as AnalysisPage
  participant S as TxService
  participant R as Repository
  participant F as Features
  participant X as RulesV1
  A->>P: submit form
  P->>P: validate()
  alt invalid
    P-->>A: field errors
  else valid
    P->>S: analyze(record)
    S->>R: list()
    R-->>S: prior records
    S->>F: engineer features
    F-->>S: features, baseline
    S->>X: analyzeTransaction()
    X-->>S: score, factors
    S-->>P: AnalysisResult
    P->>S: save(tx)
    S->>R: save(tx)
    R-->>S: stored
    P-->>A: result + saved message
  end
